# Web

- Build components with semantic HTML (`button`, `a`, `input`, `dialog`) and style them with `styles/foundations.css`.
- Component CSS and React `style` use `var(--*)` from `styles/foundations.css` only. No hex, raw px, raw shadow, or font name in a component.
- Keyboard: visible `:focus-visible`, a logical tab order, and Escape closes overlays.
- Hover states add feedback. An action must still be available without a pointer.
- Meet a 44×44 px minimum target. Name every control for assistive tech.

```css
/* ❌ BAD */
.button:hover { background: #123; }

/* ✅ GOOD */
.button:hover { background: var(--surface-hover); }
.button:focus-visible { outline: var(--focus-ring); }
```
